WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

02:12.028 --> 02:13.779
Black Jack...

02:16.685 --> 02:19.868
Originally "Shrinking” by Tezuka Osamu

02:16.685 --> 02:19.868
Shrinking!

02:26.960 --> 02:29.211
I'll be away somewhere between a week and ten days.

02:29.212 --> 02:31.272
It might even be longer.

02:31.464 --> 02:32.756
Watch the house while I'm gone.

02:32.757 --> 02:33.424
OK!

02:33.425 --> 02:35.592
Aye-aye!

02:36.511 --> 02:38.387
Not fighting back like you usually do?

02:38.388 --> 02:40.431
I'll send you off with a smile today.

02:40.432 --> 02:43.308
That's what a wife does.

02:43.309 --> 02:47.781
And I can't miss the final episode of this drama series.

02:48.273 --> 02:50.607
What? You have something to say?

02:52.068 --> 02:53.360
See ya.

02:53.361 --> 02:54.611
OK!

02:54.612 --> 02:56.488
Have a good one!

02:56.489 --> 02:59.033
Travel safely!

03:02.370 --> 03:05.039
<i>Hazama Kuroo—no, Black Jack—</i>

03:05.040 --> 03:07.979
<i>You're probably shocked by this sudden letter.</i>

03:08.251 --> 03:11.101
<i>I wish to request your assistance.</i>

03:11.296 --> 03:14.340
<i>I cannot write the details for certain reasons,</i>

03:14.341 --> 03:17.551
<i>but I really need your help.</i>

03:17.552 --> 03:19.889
<i>Please fly here as soon as possible.</i>

03:20.138 --> 03:21.388
<i>See you then.</i>

03:26.859 --> 03:28.249
Dr. Black Jack!

03:30.048 --> 03:31.440
Welcome.

03:31.441 --> 03:34.660
I'm White, Dr. Togakushi's assistant.

03:39.821 --> 03:44.074
Starvation from drought, terrible communal diseases—

03:44.329 --> 03:45.719
It's horrible here.

03:46.100 --> 03:49.750
The land around here is no longer suitable
for any form of life to inhabit.

03:55.423 --> 03:57.132
Black Jack!

03:58.385 --> 03:59.795
Dr. Togakushi.

04:00.104 --> 04:01.438
How have you been?

04:02.231 --> 04:03.857
I'm glad to see you.

04:04.171 --> 04:08.695
You haven't changed at all, like suddenly sending me
a letter and summoning me to such a remote land.

04:09.822 --> 04:12.407
How many years has it been since we last met?

04:14.535 --> 04:15.590
Indeed, it's been a while.

04:24.003 --> 04:26.963
So Doctor, what's happening?

04:28.299 --> 04:30.175
Come in.

04:38.434 --> 04:40.811
Take a look at this.

04:43.147 --> 04:44.216
Is it a doll?

04:44.565 --> 04:47.067
No, it's a real, stuffed specimen

04:47.068 --> 04:48.860
of a lion.

04:48.861 --> 04:49.986
What?!

04:50.780 --> 04:52.466
How can that be?!

04:52.949 --> 04:54.658
Then are they all—

04:54.659 --> 04:58.662
Yes, they were all once living adult animals.

04:59.497 --> 05:04.209
I first thought they had some anomalous development,

05:04.210 --> 05:07.170
but further research indicated
that it was a type of atrophy—

05:07.230 --> 05:10.777
a communal disease where the body shrinks.

05:11.070 --> 05:13.606
And in the end, they die.

05:14.929 --> 05:16.748
The body shrinks?

05:17.014 --> 05:21.226
Moreover, this symptom was only seen in a limited area,

05:21.430 --> 05:22.811
but it started spreading.

05:22.812 --> 05:25.922
And it's starting to affect people too.

05:26.774 --> 05:31.194
I tried every treatment I could think
of, but nothing's worked so far.

05:31.195 --> 05:35.263
The treatment, the root cause—
they're both still a mystery.

05:35.881 --> 05:40.203
If this communal disease is real, then
why are you not reporting it?!

05:40.335 --> 05:41.830
Just imagine if I did do that!

05:41.831 --> 05:44.374
The entire world would be in a panic!

05:44.375 --> 05:48.295
And the people who are overwhelmed
by their fear will close this area off,

05:48.296 --> 05:51.840
killing everything in it.

05:52.592 --> 05:55.302
Black Jack, please help!

05:55.303 --> 06:01.516
I want you, my student with the best surgical skill
ever, to find the cure for this mysterious disease.

06:02.351 --> 06:03.226
I see.

06:03.227 --> 06:06.097
So those are the details of the request?

06:06.314 --> 06:08.475
Doctor, my treatment will be expensive.

06:08.733 --> 06:10.066
Just like I heard from the rumors.

06:10.067 --> 06:12.235
And you're even making me pay.

06:13.112 --> 06:14.613
Your reward will be 20,000,000.

06:14.614 --> 06:17.199
That's the maximum amount this
country's government can offer.

06:18.034 --> 06:19.201
Black Jack!

06:19.202 --> 06:20.660
Out of the question!

06:20.900 --> 06:21.628
100,000,000.

06:21.829 --> 06:23.872
I want at least 100,000,000.

06:23.873 --> 06:25.040
What?!

06:25.041 --> 06:27.918
Finding out the truth about this disease
may save the entire human race,

06:27.919 --> 06:32.297
or even all life on this planet!

06:32.298 --> 06:33.924
That's none of my business!

06:33.925 --> 06:36.927
Besides, I'm a surgeon and have no interest in research.

06:36.928 --> 06:38.845
Please ask a specialist.

06:40.348 --> 06:41.848
I see what's going on.

06:41.849 --> 06:43.892
You are scared of this disease.

06:43.893 --> 06:45.352
You're scared of being infected, aren't you?

06:46.312 --> 06:48.313
Then it may be too late.

06:48.314 --> 06:51.249
There is a possibility that you may already be infected,

06:52.455 --> 06:57.114
because you directly touched a patient with your hand.

06:57.450 --> 06:58.331
Where...

07:03.693 --> 07:07.228
Maybe your body does seem a bit small.

07:07.458 --> 07:08.333
Yes.

07:08.334 --> 07:12.295
I am infected with this disease and
have developed the symptom.

07:15.630 --> 07:19.063
My body's been shrinking for a week now.

07:19.303 --> 07:21.555
The incubation period for this disease is a month.

07:21.556 --> 07:24.544
If you are infected, you will shrink too.

07:24.892 --> 07:29.688
And if you go home now, you will spread
this disease to the entire world.

07:30.606 --> 07:33.191
So now what will you do, Black Jack?

07:43.826 --> 07:45.245
Day 5 of my stay.

07:45.246 --> 07:47.398
I keep running diagnoses on Dr. Togakushi.

07:47.932 --> 07:51.559
I've hypothesized from many different angles
and collected numerous data to verify them,

07:51.878 --> 07:53.805
but I cannot find any abnormalities.

07:54.088 --> 07:57.674
But the patient's body is shrinking every day!

08:00.614 --> 08:03.885
The cells are shrinking while keeping
their orlgmal structure.

08:04.541 --> 08:06.725
And the old cells look young.

08:06.726 --> 08:10.312
So, this shrinking symptom is not a disease...

08:10.762 --> 08:13.774
is it caused by something else?

08:14.081 --> 08:17.444
Animals and people are dying because of this disease.

08:18.332 --> 08:19.887
But what's causing it?

08:35.713 --> 08:37.172
Doctor!

08:37.173 --> 08:37.974
Why...

08:38.216 --> 08:39.591
Why are they shrinking?!

08:39.592 --> 08:41.949
It's no use, Doctor.

08:42.220 --> 08:44.763
There's no way you can find the truth behind this disease.

08:44.764 --> 08:45.911
Quit being skeptical.

08:46.224 --> 08:48.475
I want as many samples as I can get,

08:48.867 --> 08:50.852
so I don't care what species it is.

08:51.046 --> 08:53.313
Are you not scared?

08:53.314 --> 08:55.816
Once I accept a job, I always complete it.

08:55.817 --> 08:57.526
That is my ideology.

08:57.527 --> 08:58.485
But...

08:58.486 --> 09:01.909
Also,although it was a discount, this
job will bring in 20,000,000.

09:02.198 --> 09:05.867
But it does no good if you die before getting it.

09:12.417 --> 09:13.250
It's a rhino.

09:13.835 --> 09:14.948
And it's still alive!

09:16.212 --> 09:18.004
It's shrunk quite a bit.

09:18.005 --> 09:18.626
Yeah.

09:18.881 --> 09:19.965
Give me a hand.

09:19.966 --> 09:21.049
Let's take it to the lab.

09:21.050 --> 09:21.758
OK.

09:30.726 --> 09:32.018
I got hurt!

09:32.520 --> 09:33.270
Are you OK?

09:33.271 --> 09:35.939
That infected rhino injured me.

09:35.940 --> 09:37.524
Now I'm infected too!

09:37.525 --> 09:38.400
Calm down!

09:38.401 --> 09:39.943
It's not definite yet.

09:39.944 --> 09:42.237
I know I'm infected!

09:42.238 --> 09:43.238
I'm totally done for.

09:43.239 --> 09:45.631
My body will shrink too.

09:45.825 --> 09:47.554
I'm doomed!

09:53.708 --> 09:55.834
Doctor, let's run away.

09:57.378 --> 09:58.837
I can't stand it anymore!

09:58.838 --> 10:01.089
I don't want to stay here a second longer!

10:01.090 --> 10:03.049
Let's run away with this car!

10:03.050 --> 10:04.801
Go ahead if you want.

10:04.802 --> 10:05.969
I'm staying.

10:08.473 --> 10:10.098
Then give me the car!

10:10.433 --> 10:11.558
I will run!

10:11.559 --> 10:13.518
I will run and live!

10:22.973 --> 10:24.909
Oh, bother.

10:25.173 --> 10:26.919
Doc's cup.

10:27.366 --> 10:29.883
I wonder if he's doing OK.

10:43.091 --> 10:44.067
Take a look at this.

10:44.909 --> 10:48.595
This is an elephant I found dead in the drought
area ninety kilometers west of here.

10:49.305 --> 10:51.649
Judging from the tusks, it's an adult elephant.

10:51.891 --> 10:55.644
It's slow, but the infected area is spreading.

10:55.899 --> 10:56.496
Yes.

10:56.771 --> 10:58.939
Looks like we don't have much time left.

10:58.940 --> 11:00.607
We must hurry with our research.

11:03.486 --> 11:05.237
Day 10.

11:05.238 --> 11:06.863
<i>Not only have we not found a cure for the disease,</i>

11:06.864 --> 11:09.874
<i>but there's not even so much as a hint that might
bring us closer to the truth behind it.</i>

11:10.496 --> 11:12.310
<i>What in the world is this disease?</i>

11:12.703 --> 11:14.913
<i>Just what is going on here?</i>

11:15.915 --> 11:17.332
Black Jack,

11:19.419 --> 11:21.457
do you want to take a break?

11:24.340 --> 11:28.510
Spending time with you reminds
me of a time from the old days.

11:28.511 --> 11:33.432
It was when you were still an intern.

11:34.413 --> 11:35.517
<i>Don't be so conceited!</i>

11:35.518 --> 11:38.061
<i>A doctor's skill alone won't save the patient's life!</i>

11:38.428 --> 11:39.623
<i>But Doctor!</i>

11:39.950 --> 11:40.791
<i>Don't you see?!</i>

11:40.816 --> 11:46.643
<i>If there were any mistakes, you could
have killed your patient—that girl!</i>

11:49.318 --> 11:54.286
You were still a doctor that was wet behind
the ears, thinking that skill was everything.

11:55.077 --> 12:00.876
But then I got fed up with the Japanese medical
system, left the country, and ended up like this.

12:01.319 --> 12:03.475
So I couldn't laugh at your immaturity.

12:03.906 --> 12:06.283
Doctor, it's getting late.

12:06.591 --> 12:07.923
Let's get some rest.

12:08.259 --> 12:09.217
Right.

12:19.729 --> 12:20.520
Hey!

12:22.023 --> 12:23.482
What do you want?

12:23.483 --> 12:25.192
Do people live up ahead?

12:25.193 --> 12:27.405
Nope, everybody's left.

12:27.612 --> 12:29.154
We're fleeing too.

12:29.508 --> 12:30.552
Fleeing?

12:31.465 --> 12:33.575
There's no food or water left.

12:33.576 --> 12:35.452
And now that disease.

12:35.453 --> 12:37.579
Everyone shrank and died.

12:37.580 --> 12:39.039
Don't tell him that.

12:39.496 --> 12:41.666
A disease where you shrink and die?

12:41.667 --> 12:42.793
Tell me!

12:42.794 --> 12:43.752
Where is this village?!

12:43.987 --> 12:46.880
It's twenty kilometers west of here.

12:46.881 --> 12:48.965
But you'd better not go near it.

12:48.966 --> 12:51.639
I'm sure it's God's divine punishment.

12:55.848 --> 12:57.682
God's divine punishment...

13:07.944 --> 13:09.065
<i>Day 11.</i>

13:09.529 --> 13:12.864
<i>The village seventy kilometers to the south was hit.</i>

13:13.908 --> 13:21.206
<i>All that's left here are the figures of dead
cattle and people who died helplessly.</i>

13:26.774 --> 13:27.398
Doctor,

13:27.422 --> 13:28.942
this is subjectively speaking,

13:29.841 --> 13:34.345
but the areas where this disease spreads
is always a place with severe drought.

13:34.707 --> 13:35.489
Drought?

13:35.513 --> 13:38.622
Is that somehow related to this disease?

13:39.374 --> 13:40.160
I don't know.

13:40.184 --> 13:41.729
I can't find anything.

13:42.520 --> 13:45.105
There's nothing wrong with the
body, yet it keeps shrinking.

13:45.466 --> 13:48.483
Animals, people—they all shrink!

13:48.484 --> 13:50.496
And they eventually die.

13:52.363 --> 13:54.622
And all I can do is just watch!

13:54.907 --> 13:55.824
It's like...

13:56.117 --> 13:59.035
It's like I'm being strangled with a cotton cloth!

13:59.036 --> 14:00.797
You're giving up already?

14:01.841 --> 14:05.168
And this is the notorious Black Jack!

14:05.501 --> 14:06.501
How pathetic!

14:07.420 --> 14:11.506
You should know what to do next!

14:11.507 --> 14:13.383
But Doctor! That's...

14:13.437 --> 14:14.175
It's OK!

14:14.704 --> 14:16.928
Use my body!

14:16.929 --> 14:22.267
Overcome this disease even if you must
use my body as your guinea pig!

14:22.268 --> 14:23.977
Black Jack!

14:27.273 --> 14:30.052
I will make a local incision and implant
some thyroid preparation.

14:32.904 --> 14:36.198
Black Jack, do you hate me?

14:36.554 --> 14:37.440
Doctor...

14:37.784 --> 14:41.203
I won't ask your forgiveness for
getting you involved in all this.

14:41.204 --> 14:45.165
But I could think of no other way.

14:45.422 --> 14:47.790
I'm really sorry.

14:51.881 --> 14:54.273
<i>I never hated you, Doctor.</i>

14:57.428 --> 14:59.168
<i>Day 15.</i>

14:59.430 --> 15:00.926
<i>I started the first operation.</i>

15:01.349 --> 15:04.017
<i>As long as I'm using my scalpel,
no mistakes are permissible.</i>

15:04.018 --> 15:09.434
<i>But have I ever performed an operation
that made me so anxious?</i>

15:13.202 --> 15:15.766
Administering thyroid preparation.

15:23.898 --> 15:25.141
<i>It's been five days since the operation.</i>

15:25.581 --> 15:28.083
<i>There's no sign of the operation having any effect.</i>

15:28.084 --> 15:31.545
<i>Dr. Togakushi's body is still shrinking like before.</i>

15:34.048 --> 15:37.634
<i>Day 21. I performed the second
operation on Dr. Togakushi.</i>

15:38.078 --> 15:42.305
<i>I opened the skull and implanted !
a cell proliferation agent.</i>

15:42.540 --> 15:44.404
<i>I don't know if it will be effective.</i>

15:45.184 --> 15:47.111
<i>But, please...</i>

15:57.780 --> 15:59.296
<i>Day 25.</i>

15:59.699 --> 16:01.815
<i>The second operation was a failure too.</i>

16:02.410 --> 16:06.663
<i>Dr. Togakushi has shrunk to the size of
a baby, and he has fallen into a coma.</i>

16:07.165 --> 16:09.488
<i>I repeat blood transfusions and injections of cardiotonic.</i>

16:15.214 --> 16:16.089
Doctor!

16:16.674 --> 16:19.272
I thought about this in my dream...

16:19.510 --> 16:24.347
A few days ago you said the disease would
spread in areas with a drought.

16:25.243 --> 16:30.563
During a shortage of food, wild
rats produce small offspring;

16:30.563 --> 16:33.408
therefore fewer offspring survive.

16:33.691 --> 16:36.026
But Doctor, that's not a disease.

16:36.027 --> 16:37.319
It is a natural phenomenon.

16:37.587 --> 16:40.197
Right, that's how nature works.

16:40.198 --> 16:42.491
Perhaps this is the same as that.

16:43.534 --> 16:44.952
We don't know the cause,

16:45.203 --> 16:46.578
there's nothing wrong in the bodies,

16:46.579 --> 16:47.913
and yet they die!

16:47.914 --> 16:54.023
And you consider these deaths part
of a natural phenomenon?!

16:55.379 --> 16:57.308
That doesn't solve anything!

17:01.469 --> 17:03.136
Everything keeps shrinking.

17:04.829 --> 17:05.806
Why?!

17:05.807 --> 17:07.599
Why do they shrink?!

17:08.879 --> 17:10.102
Give me a hint!

17:10.103 --> 17:10.936
A hint!

17:10.937 --> 17:13.021
If you do, I'll give you 100,000,000!

17:13.648 --> 17:17.526
No, 1,000,000,000! Or as much as you want!

17:26.119 --> 17:28.787
Hang in there, Doc...

17:38.354 --> 17:39.438
<i>Day 28.</i>

17:40.133 --> 17:43.308
<i>I still haven't found a cure, and
now I'm out of things to try.</i>

17:43.594 --> 17:45.095
<i>I feel utterly helpless.</i>

17:48.599 --> 17:50.684
I envy you, looking so relaxed.

17:51.727 --> 17:55.621
By the way, you've been with him all this
time, so why aren't you infected?

17:56.248 --> 17:58.066
Chickens are getting infected.

17:58.067 --> 18:00.402
But why not you, since you're also a bird?

18:03.364 --> 18:04.156
Could it be?!

18:11.306 --> 18:13.232
This is the area where I found that rhinoceros.

18:13.541 --> 18:16.126
If the disease is spreading among the animals,

18:16.127 --> 18:19.695
why do some remain that are still healthy?

18:21.632 --> 18:22.639
Why?

18:27.722 --> 18:29.097
It's a herd of zebras.

18:34.979 --> 18:37.397
They're eating the corpse of one of their own.

18:38.274 --> 18:41.485
And others are digging the dirt and eating it.

18:42.069 --> 18:44.654
Neither parrots nor zebras are carnivorous.

18:44.655 --> 18:46.364
And why the dirt?

18:47.366 --> 18:48.450
Could it be?!

18:51.329 --> 18:52.455
Do they...

18:54.415 --> 19:00.173
instinctively know to ingest whatever
is effective from the dead body?

19:00.588 --> 19:03.034
And this dirt they were eating...

19:04.451 --> 19:06.676
Maybe this is the key!

19:18.773 --> 19:22.146
This dirt contains three thousand
times more calcium than normal.

19:22.568 --> 19:23.777
That means...

19:37.667 --> 19:39.709
There's no change in the cell.

19:39.892 --> 19:40.627
Yes!

19:40.778 --> 19:41.647
I finally did it!

19:42.185 --> 19:46.466
I can prevent the body shrinkage with this!

19:47.051 --> 19:47.926
Doctor!

19:47.927 --> 19:48.718
I did it!

19:48.719 --> 19:50.762
I made the medication!

19:50.763 --> 19:51.868
I'll give it to you now!

19:53.818 --> 19:55.267
Doctor, don't you see?

19:55.268 --> 19:56.258
You'll be safe!

19:56.811 --> 20:00.147
Did you find the cause of the disease?

20:00.148 --> 20:01.273
No, not that.

20:01.274 --> 20:04.531
But I made a medication that will stop its progression!

20:05.069 --> 20:07.728
Good job, Black Jack.

20:07.879 --> 20:10.157
Use it on yourself.

20:10.825 --> 20:13.119
I won't survive.

20:13.432 --> 20:14.872
I am ready to die.

20:15.319 --> 20:16.663
Doctor! Why?!

20:16.664 --> 20:19.374
We finally have a way to overcome this disease,

20:19.375 --> 20:20.798
but if I lose you...

20:21.127 --> 20:22.486
Don't give up!

20:22.754 --> 20:24.838
It's OK.

20:25.548 --> 20:30.552
There's probably no real cause for this disease.

20:30.553 --> 20:36.850
If there is one, it'd be a warning from God.

20:38.269 --> 20:39.491
From God?

20:40.188 --> 20:41.088
Yes.

20:41.355 --> 20:45.575
I think I can see His message.

20:46.068 --> 20:51.183
By shrinking the bodies in famine-plagued areas,

20:51.491 --> 20:55.516
he may be trying to tell us that we must shrink our bodies

20:55.973 --> 21:05.206
in order for all creatures to survive on this
planet Earth with its limited resources.

21:08.716 --> 21:15.048
But I'm sure people will continue to survive.

21:15.473 --> 21:19.392
Right, Black Jack?

21:23.856 --> 21:24.815
Dr. Togakushi!

21:24.909 --> 21:25.533
Doctor!

21:27.102 --> 21:28.074
Doctor!

21:44.085 --> 21:45.168
God!

21:45.169 --> 21:46.557
You're cruel!

21:46.921 --> 21:49.381
Doctors cure patients to save their lives!

21:49.382 --> 21:54.928
And if the world is overpopulated as a result, causing
food shortages and the death of many...

21:54.929 --> 21:56.680
If that's your message,

21:57.849 --> 21:58.774
then why...

22:00.810 --> 22:03.856
Why do doctors exist?!

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
Only look straight at me.

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.917 --> 22:57.300
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.917 --> 22:53.122
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.577 --> 22:57.301
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.045 --> 23:43.930
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.045 --> 23:36.978
sora no hate tooku

23:37.071 --> 23:43.871
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.129 --> 24:15.107
The Birth of Pinoco

23:45.489 --> 23:46.636
I know of no such child!

23:48.169 --> 23:49.302
Ohmygewdness!

23:49.409 --> 23:50.029
You see...

23:53.322 --> 23:54.022
A curse?

23:55.666 --> 23:56.059
Don't cut!

23:56.572 --> 23:57.292
Don't cut!

23:57.659 --> 23:58.319
Don't cut!

23:58.786 --> 24:00.519
Why are you keeping it alive?!

24:01.512 --> 24:02.632
Fetus in fetu?

24:03.135 --> 24:03.742
Is that you?

24:05.715 --> 24:07.502
Don't think about getting any help.

24:08.948 --> 24:09.808
Who is she?!

24:10.222 --> 24:10.995
She's your...

24:11.611 --> 24:13.811
Next Karte - The Birth of Pinoco.

24:16.096 --> 24:17.781
Karte NG...

24:20.225 --> 24:21.142
It's a rhino.

24:21.685 --> 24:22.762
And it's still alive!
